== zl1 governor temperature A/B -- 1970-02-13T20:57:23Z UTC
  device:      Letv Technologies, Inc. MSM 8996pro + PMI8996 LE_ZL1-DVT1
  cores:       4 (/sys/devices/system/cpu/cpu0/cpufreq/scaling_governor /sys/devices/system/cpu/cpu1/cpufreq/scaling_governor /sys/devices/system/cpu/cpu2/cpufreq/scaling_governor /sys/devices/system/cpu/cpu3/cpufreq/scaling_governor)
  instrument:  /tmp/zl1-thermal.sh
  windows:     45s each, 20s after each write
  holds:       up to 300s before A, up to 240s before C, at a 0.5 C bar, every 10s
  states:      A/C 'interactive' (the fix, installed)  B 'performance' (the image's own value)
